                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \hat \omega \in \Omega^n_{vert,cl}(U \times B^{k+1})
              that is radially constant in a neighbourhood of the boundary for all
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
