            %p
              To complete the proof we have to show that this simple argument does extend to smooth families of forms, i.e., that we can choose the
              = succeed "-form" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
